\cf0 When you learn \'97 companionship\
The microphone points toward the relevant interval or chord and explains why it works. The mascot's presence makes the experience conversational, while the musical visualization does the actual teaching.\
Notice that only the musical visualization needs to be fluid. The microphone remains a solid, illustrated character, and the controls remain stable.\
That contrast can actually make the app feel more intentional, rather than less cohesive.\
